"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Simpan folder ekstensi, buka halaman ekstensi browser, aktifkan mode Pengembang, pilih Load unpacked, lalu pilih foldernya.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Simpan file add-on lalu seret ke jendela Firefox. Firefox memasang add-on yang ditandatangani; lihat README untuk menandatangani salinan Anda.";
